path(\"a[0][1][2].b.c\")\n        ['a', 0, 1, 2, 'b', 'c']\n\n    .. versionadded:: 4.0.0\n\n    .. versionchanged:: 4.2.1\n        Ensure returned path is always a list.\n    \"\"\"\n    path = [token.key for tok"}}
